{"anchorHero":{"uid":"tigreal","name":"Tigreal","roles":["tank"],"lanes":["roam"]},"outputLanguage":"en","synergies":[{"synergyHeroId":"aurora","reasons":["Aurora can layer freeze and magic burst after Tigreal pulls enemies together.","The combined control gives the team a longer window to damage grouped targets."],"synergyTypes":["cc-chain","teamfight-combo","setup-combo"],"proof":[{"id":"aurora-freeze-chains-after-tigreal-engage","category":"crowd-control-chain","priority":"secondary","impact":"high","summary":"Tigreal groups the enemy team, and Aurora follows with freeze control plus AoE magic damage into the same cluster."}],"synergyHero":{"uid":"aurora","name":"Aurora","roles":["mage"],"lanes":["mid"]}},{"synergyHeroId":"claude","reasons":["Claude can follow Tigreal's engage with Blazing Duet into enemies held close together.","Tigreal gives Claude a safer entry window by starting and absorbing the first layer of the fight."],"synergyTypes":["engage-follow-up","aoe-follow-up","teamfight-combo"],"proof":[{"id":"claude-blazing-duet-follows-tigreal-engage","category":"engage-follow-up","priority":"primary","impact":"high","summary":"Tigreal starts the grouped fight, and Claude enters after the setup to apply Blazing Duet damage around the controlled enemies."}],"synergyHero":{"uid":"claude","name":"Claude","roles":["marksman"],"lanes":["gold"]}},{"synergyHeroId":"eudora","reasons":["Eudora can quickly burst a priority target that Tigreal has stunned or displaced.","Tigreal's control helps Eudora land her full combo on a target that would otherwise move away."],"synergyTypes":["pickoff-combo","burst-follow-up","setup-combo"],"proof":[{"id":"eudora-burst-follows-tigreal-control","category":"pickoff-combo","priority":"secondary","impact":"high","summary":"Tigreal locks a target in place, and Eudora follows with single-target magic burst during the control window."}],"synergyHero":{"uid":"eudora","name":"Eudora","roles":["mage"],"lanes":["mid"]}},{"synergyHeroId":"odette","reasons":["Odette can channel Swan Song after Tigreal groups enemies in one fight area.","Tigreal's setup increases the value of Odette's AoE damage during teamfights."],"synergyTypes":["setup-combo","aoe-follow-up","teamfight-combo"],"proof":[{"id":"odette-swan-song-follows-tigreal-group-engage","category":"setup-combo","priority":"primary","impact":"high","summary":"Tigreal creates the grouped engage, and Odette follows with Swan Song AoE damage while enemies are controlled or forced to stay nearby."}],"synergyHero":{"uid":"odette","name":"Odette","roles":["mage"],"lanes":["mid"]}},{"synergyHeroId":"pharsa","reasons":["Pharsa can follow Tigreal's grouped crowd-control setup with long-range AoE burst.","Tigreal's frontline engage lets Pharsa deal damage from a safer backline angle."],"synergyTypes":["teamfight-combo","engage-follow-up","aoe-follow-up"],"proof":[{"id":"pharsa-airstrike-follows-tigreal-implosion","category":"engage-follow-up","priority":"primary","impact":"high","summary":"Tigreal groups and stuns enemies, while Pharsa follows from range with AoE burst into the controlled area."}],"synergyHero":{"uid":"pharsa","name":"Pharsa","roles":["mage"],"lanes":["mid"]}}]}
